      "beat_id": "S05",
      "act": "THE TEST",
      "tone": "firm, the payoff",
      "narration_text": "So why random? Give the player more information and find out. Let it see where it is, and the coin vanishes: right, left, right, three steps. But in rock, paper, scissors, against an opponent who learns your habits, the coin survives. Lean on rock, and you get punished.",
